---
import profilePhoto from "../../assets/img/profile-photo.png";
---

<!-- Main container -->
<div
  class="mx-auto mt-20 flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-8 px-6 lg:flex-row "
>
  <!-- Image -->
  <div
    class="border-primary h-64 w-64 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg md:h-96 md:w-96 drop-shadow-[4px_4px_0_#7836cf]"
  >
    <img
      src={profilePhoto.src}
      alt="Template profile portrait"
      class="h-full w-full object-cover"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Text -->
  <div class="flex-1 text-center text-gray-300 lg:text-left">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">
      Meet <span class="text-white text-shadow">Alex Developer</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4">
      This portfolio template is written for a full-stack software developer
      with a focus on <span class="text-primary font-semibold"
        >front-end engineering</span
      > and
      <span class="text-primary font-semibold">user experience</span>. Use this
      space to describe how you connect interfaces, business logic, APIs, and
      databases to ship useful products.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Replace this paragraph with your background. Mention the moment you became
      interested in <span class="text-primary font-semibold">technology</span>,
      the tools you learned first, and the kind of
      <span class="text-primary font-semibold">software problems</span> you
      enjoy solving.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Close with your current goals, preferred collaboration style, and the
      value you bring to a team. Keep it specific, honest, and easy to scan.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
